        "config": {
          "text": "A crude voice: a 110 Hz buzz (the vocal cords) through two bandpass filters (the mouth). The two step sequencers move the filters through the vowels a, e, i, o, u on every syllable, and an envelope gates the syllables. Draw new values in the sequencers to make it say something else."
