        "id": "17",
        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "Try this:\n• Shorten the Vocoder's release to 0.01 s for crisper words, or lengthen it to 0.3 s for a smeared choir.\n• Set the carrier's Hiss gain to −60 and hear the consonants vanish.\n• Raise Syllables' interval to 1 beat for a slow, singing robot.\n• With Use Audio In on, wire the Microphone into a Meter first to check your level: quiet voices need more of the Vocoder's level."
